>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SIMULADOR-PARCELAS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VALOR-COMPRA       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-QTD-PARCELAS       PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-VALOR-PARCELA      PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-I                  PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-ACUMULADO          PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Valor da compra: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-VALOR-COMPRA
    DISPLAY "Quantidade de parcelas (1 a 12): " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-QTD-PARCELAS

    IF WS-QTD-PARCELAS = ZERO OR WS-QTD-PARCELAS > 12
        DISPLAY "Quantidade de parcelas invalida."
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-VALOR-PARCELA ROUNDED = WS-VALOR-COMPRA / WS-QTD-PARCELAS
        DISPLAY ""
        DISPLAY "PARCELA  VALOR      ACUMULADO"
        PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-QTD-PARCELAS
            ADD WS-VALOR-PARCELA TO WS-ACUMULADO
            DISPLAY WS-I "        " WS-VALOR-PARCELA "    " WS-ACUMULADO
        END-PERFORM
        DISPLAY "Observacao: o arredondamento pode gerar pequena diferenca final."
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
